  "featuresTaskDuePredictionInfo": "Estimates when a task will come due. For date and duration intervals, this is calculated directly from the last completion, no Strava needed. For other intervals (distance, elevation, ride time, ...), it extrapolates from how much the bike has been ridden recently and needs a connected Strava subscription. Only shows for tasks that are not due yet.",
